                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Stophat is an arcade game about putting a hat on a man.\n\nThe man doesn't want you putting the hat on him, it is a stubborn man. So, you have to constantly try to put the hat on him and it becomes increasingly hard to do so. I've read the description and I'm aware it's a game made in 48 hours, so no big deal. But at the same time, charging for such a game is just a little weird. I mean you do you, for free it would be fine and the concept is unique and the music is not too bad, but yeah I'm just mixed about it.\n\nOverall, a 5-10 minutes game about putting a hat on a man. It's alright but not worth charging for.",
